Package: hcc2d-streamer
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: stream files through QR and HCC2D symbols
 Single-file C command-line application that transfers files by displaying
 repeating sequences of standard QR, four-color HCC2D, or eight-color
 HCC2D symbols in an SDL2 window.
 .
 The receiver can recover a file after capturing a sufficient subset of the
 Reed-Solomon-protected symbols with the HCC2D Decoder companion app.
 HCC2DST v2 streams require HCC2D Decoder version 1.2.4 or later.
